  "title": "Why September 19th Matters In Rock History",
  "standfirst": "Find out why this was a big day for Eddie Vedder in 1990 and what classic music show began on this day in 1997. | iHeart",
  "author": "Dave Basner",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-19T12:00:00+00:00",
