  "kind": "news",
  "title": "BTS' Fiery Set At The 2026 iHeartRadio Music Festival Was The Ultimate 'Mic Drop'",
  "standfirst": "BTS delivered a show-stopping performance at the iHeartRadio Music Festival 🔥 Check it out! 👀 | iHeart",
  "author": "Sarah Tate",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-19T05:57:00+00:00",
