      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Raven-Symoné had an odd request for BTS during her time at the 2026 iHeartRadio Music Festival . While on the blue carpet on Friday night, September 18, the \"That's So Raven\" actress spoke with Becky Mits about meeting the popular K-POP band. During their conversation, Raven revealed that she wants an opportunity to meet the guys so that she could get a whiff of what they smell like. \"I wanna know what they smell [like],\" the famed actress said. \"I have this thing. I have met a lot of different people in this industry and I met them when I was younger. So when you're younger and you're hugging someone, they tend to smother you.\""
