  "kind": "news",
  "title": "Major Lazer 'Leave It All On The Stage' In High-Energy Festival Performance",
  "standfirst": "Major Lazer turned the Las Vegas arena into a rave for the group's energetic set at the 2026 iHeartRadio Music Festival. | iHeart",
  "author": "Sarah Tate",
  "publishedAt": "2026-09-20T07:19:00+00:00",
  "entityId": "553ccc0bc95d8e6249072468ea72f1ec",
