  "title": "Smashing Pumpkins Give Preview Of New Tour With 'Mellon Collie' Hits At Vegas Festival",
  "standfirst": "The iconic band gave a glimpse at its upcoming 'Rats in a Cage Tour' at the 2026 iHeartRadio Music Festival. | iHeart",
